<p>Baitha hai leke hakime khudsar sare Hussain,<br>
Rakha hua hai tasht ke andar sare Hussain.</p>

<p>Is wajah se jabee'n mubarak hai lal lal,<br>
Khaya hai raahe shaam me pathar sare Hussain.</p>

<p>Kya qeher hai ke zeenat e tasht e tila ke baad,<br>
Rakhha gaya tandoor ke andar sare Hussain.</p>

<p>Ahle haram ko bali Sakina ko dekhne,<br>
Aaya hai qaid qane ke dar par sare Hussain.</p>

<p>Sibte Rasule paak ka Alla'h re mojuza,<br>
Quraan padh raha hai sinaa par sare Hussain.</p>

<p>Bali Sakina roti hai zindaan me jis ghadi,<br>
Tashte tila me hota hai muztar sare Hussain.</p>

<p>Marne ke baad bhi nahi araam haye haye,<br>
'Hilmi' phir aaya jata hai dar dar sare Hussain..</p>